WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Motivation: poultry processing, rehang, and why grasping whole carcasses is difficult.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Hardware: customized dual-jaw gripper with eye-in-hand sensing and independent pneumatic jaws.

00:24.000 --> 00:40.000
Gripper data: robot targets and jaw commands are represented as part of the policy action.

00:40.000 --> 00:45.000
Samples: seen and unseen carcasses define the evaluation split.

00:45.000 --> 01:20.000
Policy evaluation: diffusion-policy denoising, successes, failures, disturbances, baselines, and published results.
